	"data": "LLM Memory Landscape — April 2026 Research\n\nSurvey of current tools, techniques, and breakthroughs in LLM agent memory, with actionable improvements for our vault system.\n\nKey Findings\nKarpathy's \"LLM Wiki\" Pattern (April 2026)\nSource: Karpathy's gist\n\nThe core insight: Instead of RAG retrieval at query time, maintain a structured wiki that the LLM reads directly. The wiki is a persistent, compounding artifact — cross-references already exist, contradictions are already flagged, synthesis…",
